MERGE command is used to handle upserts

Constraints (not null, check) can be added using ALTER table statements.
Scenerio: We are getting 3 rows in source for merge 1 is update, 2 are new inserts.
        Out of 2, 1 row violates the check constraint. In this case merge will fail and no new json files will be added to _delta_log folder.
        But parquet data files are written for the success merge which do not have any impact on table data as describe history will not show these.

