CDF
===========
Track row level changes between the versions.
(inserts/deletes/pre-image update, post-image update.)

enable property at table level during creation or later using alter:
alter table <table_Name> set tblproperties(delta.enableChangeDataFeed = true);

only from the point you enabled it, change will be tracked.

-> CDF with streaming is true incremental.
.trigger(processingTime="2 seconds") -> will not work in serverless. use availableNow = true;

