==================================

min files which are present to trigger auto optimize -> spark.databricks.delta.autocompact.minNumFiles
spark.databricks.delta.autoCompact.maxFileSize  -> this property file after optimize should not be greater than this limit.


Partitioning and Data skipping:
=======================

Partitioning helps to skip reading files when query is run on partiton columns.

challenges with partitioning:
1) only apply on low cardinality columns
2) if usage pattern changes partioning need to be changed,
3) to change partitioning table must be rewritten
4) can lead to data skew

